  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/s1_sub_008.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/s1_sub_008.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_01",
      "hash64": "A2E66B60342948D4",
      "text": "Oooh ho ho ho !\\nOooh ho ho ho ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_02",
      "hash64": "A2E66E6034294DED",
      "text": "Ce monde blanc avec un soupçon d’argenté qui\\ns’étend à perte de vue ! C’est tellement chic ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_01",
      "hash64": "21F2B91E9A6ED63E",
      "text": "Tout à fait ! Qui plus est, les vêtements que tu as\\ngentiment prévus pour nous sont si chauds que\\r\\nje ne sens aucunement le froid ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_03",
      "hash64": "A2E66D6034294C3A",
      "text": "Évidemment ! Ils viennent d’une des marques\\nles plus luxueuses, et utilisent un tissu de la plus\\r\\nhaute qualité ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_02",
      "hash64": "21F2B81E9A6ED48B",
      "text": "Je plains sincèrement celles et ceux qui\\nse lancent dans l’ascension de cette montagne\\r\\nsans la tenue adéquate.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_04",
      "hash64": "A2E66860342943BB",
      "text": "Tiens donc, qui voilà... ?\\nNotre impécunieu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]xse ami[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, fidèle à son poste ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0201"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_03",
      "hash64": "21F2B71E9A6ED2D8",
      "text": "Pas d’erreur possible : l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]ea revoilà, encore\\net toujours ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_04",
      "hash64": "21F2BE1E9A6EDEBD",
      "text": "Ma chère Naire, regarde donc comme\\nses vêtements sont légers ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_05",
      "hash64": "A2E6676034294208",
      "text": "Oh là là, mais tu as raison-han !\\nComment un tissu peut-il être si fin ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_06",
      "hash64": "A2E66A6034294721",
      "text": "Dis-moi, Milio ! Se pourrait-il que les prolétaires\\nrésistent mieux au froid que nous ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_05",
      "hash64": "21F2BD1E9A6EDD0A",
      "text": "Je l’ignore, ma chère Naire.\\nMais j’ai déjà entendu certains d’entre eux dire\\r\\nqu’ils avaient eu « chaud à la fin du mois ».[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_06",
      "hash64": "21F2BC1E9A6EDB57",
      "text": "Donc... peut-être que leur corps emmagasine\\nsimplement plus de chaleur que les nôtres ?[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_07",
      "hash64": "A2E669603429456E",
      "text": "Milio, comment peux-tu...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_08",
      "hash64": "A2E6646034293CEF",
      "text": "... être aussi savant ?!\\c\\nTu mérites incontestablement le Prix Naire\\nde l’intelligence ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_07",
      "hash64": "21F2BB1E9A6ED9A4",
      "text": "Quel honneur ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_09",
      "hash64": "A2E6636034293B3C",
      "text": "C’est notre devoir en tant que privilégiés d’aider\\nles personnes dans le besoin...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_10",
      "hash64": "A2E2E660342630FE",
      "text": "Voici. En espérant que ce geste chaleureux\\nt’ira droit au cœur.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_11",
      "hash64": "A2E2E760342632B1",
      "text": "On dit que certaines personnes à l’apparence\\nfroide font preuve d’une grande chaleur\\r\\nhumaine en privé.\\c\\nMais ce ne sont que des foutaises !\\nQuand on est chaleureux, on le montre ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 184,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_12",
      "hash64": "A2E2E46034262D98",
      "text": "Tâche de ne pas l’oublier.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_08",
      "hash64": "21F2B21E9A6ECA59",
      "text": "Ma chère Naire, si le silence est d’or, alors\\ntes paroles sont des diamants de dix carats ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_13",
      "hash64": "A2E2E56034262F4B",
      "text": "Trêve de bavardages-han !\\nNos congés touchent bientôt à leur fin, Milio...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_14",
      "hash64": "A2E2EA60342637CA",
      "text": "Pour conclure ce voyage en beauté, rendons-nous\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]pile au centre[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] de Paldea, où nous pourrons\\r\\ndominer le reste de la région-han ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_09",
      "hash64": "21F2B11E9A6EC8A6",
      "text": "Oh oui ! Tu vas dominer la région comme\\ntu domines ton business !\\c\\nTous les influenceurs devraient prendre exemple\\nsur toi, Naire ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_10",
      "hash64": "21EFB41E9A6C97E8",
      "text": "Il est possible qu’on ne nous laisse pas entrer,\\nmais, dans le doute, je vais demander à la Ligue\\r\\nqu’on nous autorise l’accès au cratère.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "6AFA1D9089B75514",
      "text": "Madame Naire et monsieur Milio sont partis faire\\nl’ascension d’une montagne aussi immaculée\\r\\nque la réputation de notre entreprise.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_secretary_02",
      "hash64": "6AFA209089B75A2D",
      "text": "Je ne commenterai pas sur la réputation de\\nl’entreprise, mais si on me parle d’une montagne\\r\\nd’un blanc immaculé, je pense au Mont Nappé !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
